<title>FRANCE: FRENCH 98 ARMS SPENDING SEEN NEAR 80 BLN FFR - PAPER.</title>
<headline>FRENCH 98 ARMS SPENDING SEEN NEAR 80 BLN FFR - PAPER.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Allocations for arms programmes in France's 1998 defence budget are likely to fall to around 82 to 83 billion francs ($13.2 billion) from 84.9 billion francs in the 1997 budget, financial daily La Tribune reported on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The figure represents the mid-point between the 90 billion francs the defence ministry sought and the 75 billion francs the finance ministry demanded, the paper said, citing anonymous sources.</p>
</text>
